=== [2026-10-05T19:56:22Z] STAGE: tests
Created tests/: conftest.py (fixtures, ScriptedProvider), test_schema.py, test_parser.py, test_aggregate.py, test_prompting_and_planning.py (+ tests/snapshots/*.txt prompt snapshots, reviewed manually), test_runner.py, test_evaluation.py, test_cli_integration.py, test_gemini_adapter.py (fake SDK client), test_redaction.py, test_live_gemini.py (marker 'live', excluded by default).
Changes made while writing tests:
- Mock crash injection moved from frozen config (hard_exit_on_call) to env var VIDEO_REPORT_MOCK_CRASH_ON_CALL, because a frozen crash hook would re-crash every resume.
- Added providers.preflight() + override validation in create_run so invalid --concurrency or missing Gemini SDK/API key fail BEFORE a run directory is written (previously an orphan run dir could be left behind).
- Fixed ProviderError: Exception.__init__ received the unredacted message, so str(err) (printed by the CLI) could contain secrets; now redacts first. Tests extended to assert str(err)/repr(err) are clean.
- Mutation check (manual, reverted): disabling Runner._recover_interrupted made 3 runner tests fail as expected (crash/resume tests are effective).

