=== [2026-10-05T20:02:07Z] STAGE: log integrity note
Defect in the logging helper (not in the project): entries above were appended with zsh `echo`, which interprets backslash escapes in captured output. Effects found: one pytest traceback line showing the source text b"\x00" was written as a real NUL byte (replaced afterwards with the literal text \x00, matching what pytest printed), and literal "\n" sequences inside captured output (e.g. the stderr repr in the py310 failure entry) were rendered as line breaks. No outputs were otherwise edited. From this entry on, the helper uses `print -r` (raw).

